: 85.72, "w": 28.28, "h": 1.15, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "a strange light just hanging in the sky.\"", "x": 65.15, "y": 87.04, "w": 27.41, "h": 1.15, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "The area where the object was seen is a", "x": 65.12, "y": 89.74, "w": 28.32, "h": 1.15, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "combination of hills and prairie with a", "x": 65.15, "y": 91.06, "w": 26.44, "h": 1.15, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "number of the large lakes that the state", "x": 65.21, "y": 92.38, "w": 27.57, "h": 1.15, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "of Minnesota is famous for.", "x": 65.18, "y": 93.7, "w": 19.17, "h": 1.15, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "30", "x": 4.98, "y": 97.42, "w": 2.36, "h": 1.34, "fontSize": 10.0}]}